OL,3,GNEWSAFlag injunction case 'spiralling  
OL,4,Aout of control'                        
OL,6,FThe council argued that they posed a   
OL,7,Fhazard on lamp-posts, signs and other  
OL,8,Fhighway structures, and fuelled        
OL,9,Fcommunity tensions.                    
OL,11,FOn Thursday, Bridge attended another   
OL,12,Fhearing where he was told the          
OL,13,Finjunction had come into force and     
OL,14,Fwould be in place until a trial or     
OL,15,Ffurther court order.                   
